      "writtenOn": "2020-07-03T10:28:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Regarding (2), yes, I meant to produce the byte[] out of the parcel at the Java level. If it\u0027s possible for the code that makes the byte[] to throw, I think we should do try { /* code to make the byte[] ... */ } finally {parcel.recycle();}.\n\nI feel that defining a structured data type as in (1) may be too much work, but perhaps Lajos has a different view on that.",
